//imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/34_6404737526a9cd8bb90df0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/35_2632994416a9cd8bf0787c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/36_1932739886a9cd8c2b4fbe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/37_14710649426a9cd8c59580e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/38_13667706446a9cd8c92cc75.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/39_4846409306a9cd8cd045f6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/40_15703142426a9cd8d0b72be.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/41_10071222876a9cd8d42352c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/42_17393625986a9cd8d7f35c0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/43_1960576066a9cd8db660ea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/44_8711393096a9cd8deefcdb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45_2459632606a9cd8e26a064.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/46_2445005766a9cd8e5f4118.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/47_16979092976a9cd8e95790e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/48_17295428996a9cd8ed50405.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/49_836626996a9cd8f140b87.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/50_10270774786a9cd8f5442d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : EricKwok tvb即時資訊 唱錢 森美</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Sep 6 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T04:18:56.854560+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1298,"images":50,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}